{"entity_id":"npc.elwin","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Elwin / 艾尔文","language":"zh","aliases":["Elwin","艾尔文","艾文","艾尔温"],"description_short":"艾尔文是主角指挥官，适合让玩家学习前排推进、佣兵保护和路线选择的基本节奏。","description_long":"第一轮把他当稳定核心即可。不要让艾尔文独自冲入敌群，佣兵和地形才是 SRPG 的基本保险。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"none","source_refs":["l2.community_wiki","l2.localized_name_audit","l2.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.l2.elwin.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["艾尔文是谁","艾尔文是什么定位","艾文是谁"],"answer":"艾尔文是主角指挥官，适合当稳定前排核心。别让他独自冲入敌群，让佣兵和地形一起保护他。","source_refs":["l2.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"none"}]}
{"entity_id":"npc.heine","entity_type":"npc","canonical_name":"Hein / 海恩","language":"zh","aliases":["Hein","海恩"],"description_short":"海恩是早期友军，偏法术成长和支援定位，前期要避免被敌人直接贴脸。","description_long":"新手用海恩时先把安全距离放第一位。让他在指挥范围和前排保护后面输出或支援，不要当肉盾。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"none","source_refs":["l2.community_wiki","l2.strategywiki_characters","l2.localized_name_audit"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.l2.heine.zh","language":"zh","intent":"name_mapping","question_patterns":["海恩适合怎么用","海恩是谁"],"answer":"海恩偏法术和支援，前期不要顶前排。让他在佣兵和艾尔文后面输出或辅助，保持安全距离。","source_refs":["l2.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"none"}]}
